307	    <div class="ch-kick pe">An independent audit · 2026 organoid dependency catalogues · DepMap 26Q3</div>
308	    <h1 class="display hero-h">
309	      <span class="line-mask"><span>Is it the cancer,</span></span>
310	      <span class="line-mask"><span>or is it <em>the menu?</em></span></span>
311	    </h1>
312	    <p class="ch-copy pe">In 2026, two teams mapped the genes that mini-tumours grown in dishes
313	    (&ldquo;organoids&rdquo;) cannot live without — a goldmine of candidate drug targets. But organoids are fed a
314	    defined, serum-free diet that blood never resembles. We re-ran the numbers every way the public
315	    data allow, and found that <b>about 85% of the 456 differential dependencies in our reanalysis are consistent
316	    with the food, not the 3D shape.</b></p>
317	    <p class="ch-copy pe" style="margin-top:12px">Every point of light behind this text is one real gene&rsquo;s measured effect.
318	    <b>Scroll — and watch what the medium explains.</b> Hover a point to meet a gene.</p>
319	    <div class="hero-ctas pe">
320	      <a class="btn-x hot" href="#explore" data-scroll="#explore">Check any gene <span class="arr">↓</span></a>
321	      <a class="btn-x" href="#findings" data-scroll="#findings">Read the findings</a>
322	    </div>
323	    <div class="scroll-cue"><i></i> Scroll · 17,525 genes in one dish</div>
324	    <div class="stage-caption">Live data, not a picture:<br><b>17,525 points = 17,525 genes</b><br>from DepMap 26Q3 Chronos screens.<br>Colour = audit verdict.</div>
325	  </section>
