344	    <p class="ch-copy">Now every gene sits at its real coordinates: organoid effect (→) versus
345	    flat-grown, same-medium effect (↑). Genes near the dashed diagonal show a <b>similar-sized effect
346	    without any dome</b>. <b>387 of 456</b> differences meet our medium-consistency criteria — an
347	    observational consistency label, not causal proof — cholesterol factories like <b>SQLE</b> first
348	    among them.</p>
349	    <div class="axis-note ax">Δ organoid vs conventional 2D →</div>
350	    <div class="axis-note ay">Δ flat-grown, organoid medium →</div>
351	  </section>
